[00:00.54]Lesson 85 | 第85课
[00:02.94]'Paris in the Spring'. | '巴黎之春'
[00:06.34]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.75]At what time of year did Ken visit Paris? | 肯是什么时候去巴黎的?
[00:18.63]Hello, Ken. | 你好,肯。
[00:20.18]Hi, George. | 嗨,乔治。
[00:22.20]Have you just been to the cinema? | 你刚去过电影院吗?
[00:25.21]Yes, I have. | 是的,我去过。
[00:27.51]What's on? | 上映什么?
[00:29.14]'Paris in the Spring'. | '巴黎之春'。
[00:31.66]Oh, I've already seen it. | 哦,这部电影我已经看过了。
[00:34.87]I saw it on television last year. | 我去年在电视上看的。
[00:38.84]It's an old film, but it's very good. | 这是一部老电影,但非常好。
[00:43.43]Paris is a beautiful city. | 巴黎是一座美丽的城市。
[00:46.81]I've never been there. | 我从未去过那里。
[00:48.97]Have you ever been there, Ken? | 肯,你去过那里吗?
[00:52.00]Yes, I have. | 是的,我去过。
[00:53.95]I was there in April. | 我四月在那里。
[00:57.35]Paris in the spring, eh? | 巴黎之春,嗯?
[01:00.46]It was spring, but the weather was awful. | 那时候是春天,但天气糟透了。
[01:04.68]It rained all the time. | 一直在下雨。
[01:07.89]Just like London! | 就像伦敦一样!